# The variables below are NOT wired up yet. They are placeholders for the
# real backend integrations described in the product requirements doc
# (Supabase, n8n, Retell, Twilio, Calendly, Follow Up Boss) once this UI is
# connected to a real API layer instead of the in-browser mock context.

